Z||000000||Sillhouette.com||06-03-2000||06:05 PM||||Thanks to all that helped me understand how to upload pictures.  Here they are if you have any questions please email me or post here is my email address <BR>Sillhouette-com@home.com<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp00367.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp00369.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp00371.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp00373.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||06-03-2000||07:02 PM||||Looks nice!<P>what engine mods have you done?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Sillhouette.com||06-04-2000||02:13 AM||||Let's see!<P>Bored out block to 2.9 with custom pistons and dynamic balanced the crankshaft than comes the crane cam with the stronger valvesprings all new and roller rocker arms.  The exhaust manifold is ported so is the intake.  Throttle body is overboard and a cold air induction is installed with a K&N filter cone. Rapid fire sparkplgs Ac delco wires, cap and rotor stainless steel full exhaust with larger cat and oval stainless steel exhaust resonator tips.  The transmission is a five speed monzie rebuilt a year ago and for clutch I use centerforce. The engine is extremely smooth with not burps or hunting.  Very strong pull at low end and quite impressive at High end.  An Acura integra Vtech was shown the power of the Fiero. Don't know the speed because the 180KPH speedometers needle was just pointing straight down and the integra was on it's rev limit at times.  <P>Cheers||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||06-04-2000||11:42 AM|||| <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 06-04-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||06-04-2000||11:44 AM||||What's with the sub?  Looks like a neat installation.  Info?  The car looks nice. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Here are your pics in a less-than-actual-size size.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Silhouette1_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Silhouette4_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sillhouette2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sillhouette3.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||bHooper||06-04-2000||06:30 PM||||I like the color!  Nice Car !!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000006||Sillhouette.com||06-04-2000||07:04 PM||||That sub was already in the car when I bought it.  The way it was installed is they took the carpet up and built it with some very strong glue and 3/4 inch plywood.  The plastic center piece that is under your elbow column had to be trimmed where the wood is.  The compartment is completely sealed.  It give quite the shock when the 10" ORION speaker vibrates.   I also found custom four inch speakers built into the window speaker area and two tweets under the dash.  The rear speakers are factory as far as I can tell.  The deck is from my GTP.  I opted to use an AC delco deck to make it a bit more stock.  <P>Cheers.<BR>||||reg||1
