Z||000010||contra||06-05-2000||06:46 PM||||cool!<BR>i like the headlight design<BR>i've always loved fieros with the slim headlights<BR>i'm trying to work something like that out on my car, but i'm going to go all the way with the highintensity discharge bulbs. i know how to make the motors stop at the height i want and all that, but i just have to find the reflective casing to hold the lights in that is slim enough to fit in the original fiero headlight compartment.<BR>hopefully i'll be done by summer...if anybody want info on how to do slim lights i'll post a website when i get home that has all the info. <BR>l8z<BR>||||reg||3
